  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> ability to smite creatures (such as through smite evil or smite good), class feature that creates a continual aura (such as aura of courage or aura of fear)</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Whenever you make a successful attack roll against a creature you have smited, the effects of any of your auras from class features are copied as if you also occupied the space of the struck target until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/combat-feats#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
